o----------------o
|   PI HARNESS   |
o----------------o

Install pi from https://pi.dev/ inside the sandbox. To
enable dynamic model discovery and LiteLLM MCP registration:

    mkdir -p ~/.pi/agent/extensions
    cp harnesses/pi/litellm.ts ~/.pi/agent/extensions/

or

    mkdir -p ~/.pi/agent/extensions
    ln -s $(realpath harnesses/pi/litellm.ts) ~/.pi/agent/extensions/

If you ran pi previously outside the sandbox the ~/.pi
config will be picked up automatically. Otherwise this
folder will be created after running pi the first time, both
outside and inside the sandbox.
